# First sign in as the workspace's deployment operator and obtain a CSRF token.
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspace = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@csrf = replace-with-session-csrf

### Read the saved connection (never returns the API key)
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/nowledge-mem

### Discover Space names after entering a reviewed Mem server and key
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/nowledge-mem/spaces
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"apiUrl":"https://mem.example.com","apiKey":"replace-with-private-key"}

### Save disabled configuration with the actual member/Space and current revision
PUT {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/nowledge-mem
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":0,"settings":{"enabled":false,"apiUrl":"https://mem.example.com","memberId":"101","spaceId":"default","spaceName":"Default"},"apiKey":"replace-with-private-key"}

### Enable after reviewing the saved connection (use the returned revision)
PUT {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/nowledge-mem
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":1,"settings":{"enabled":true,"apiUrl":"https://mem.example.com","memberId":"101","spaceId":"default","spaceName":"Default"}}

# Private Telegram examples:
# Search Nowledge Mem for our database decision.
# Save to Nowledge Mem: We use PostgreSQL for durable application state.
# 保存到 Nowledge Mem：我們使用 PostgreSQL 儲存應用程式狀態。
